.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::GenericNodePropertyGradientLimiter< dim >"\fBGenericNodePropertyGradientLimiter\fP - limits the nodal (finite-volume) gradient of target variable\&. 

If a property (saturation, solute concentration, etc\&.\&.\&.) is advected with second order accuarcy, some sort of slope limiting is required to avoid spurious oscillations\&. This objects computes the slope limiting factor phi using the MINMOD limiter for the nodal gradients that were computed employing the object NodePropertyGradient\&. This procedure is usually carreid out automatically int the various FiniteVolume<fT, dim>\fBVisitor\fP objects\&. The resulting gradient limiter is stored automatically in the CSP_PropertyDatabase using the CSP_Operands\&.

.PP
The FiniteVolumeManager<fT, dim> and the FiniteVolume<fT, dim> classes are participants\&.

.PP
The \fBGenericNodePropertyGradientLimiter\fP object collaborates with the FiniteVolume<fT, dim>AdvectionVisitor, the FiniteVolume<fT, dim>GradientVisitor, and the FiniteVolume<fT, dim>FluidPhaseVisitor

.PP
A single \fBGenericNodePropertyGradientLimiter\fP object is automatically constructed when one of the above-mentioned visitors is constructed\&. The \fBGenericNodePropertyGradientLimiter\fP object should not be constructed from the main() file

