.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::GenericNodePropertyGradientLimiter\fP< dim >::CalculateSlopeLimiter (const \fBRegion\fP< dim > & , const std::vector< std::pair< double, double > > & MINMAX, int counter = \fR1\fP)"
Computes the 2d slope limiter for all generic finite volumes if a higher order finite volume method is used\&. The slope limiting factor is stored in an automatically at the property database\&.

.PP
The method is implemented from the various FiniteVolume<fT, dim>Visitors 
